<div class="hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">FREE FARMING TOOLS</p><h1>Free farm tools for African farmers</h1><p>Work out how much feed your animals need and how many plants, seeds and fertilizer your plot needs. Free, in 5 languages, for 54 African countries.</p><a class="btn" href="/tools/livestock-feed-calculator/nigeria/">Livestock feed calculator</a><a class="btn alt" href="/tools/crop-input-calculator/nigeria/">Crop input calculator</a></div></div>
<section><div class="wrap"><h2>Pick a tool</h2><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="/tools/livestock-feed-calculator/nigeria/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>Livestock Feed Calculator</h3><p>Daily and monthly feed and cost for poultry, fish, pigs, goats and cattle.</p></div></a><a class="card" href="/tools/crop-input-calculator/nigeria/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>Crop Input Calculator</h3><p>Plants, seed and fertilizer needed for your plot, with a hectare, acre and plot converter.</p></div></a><a class="card" href="/tools/farm-diary/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>Farm Diary</h3><p>Record expenses and sales on your phone, works offline, and see your profit.</p></div></a><a class="card" href="/tools/health-calendar/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>Livestock Health Calendar</h3><p>Ready-made vaccination and health dates for poultry, pigs, goats and cattle.</p></div></a><a class="card" href="/tools/crop-calendar/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>Crop Calendar</h3><p>Fertilizer, weeding and harvest dates for 14 crops, with phone reminders.</p></div></a></div><p><a href="/tools/">Choose your country</a></p></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><h2>Ebooks</h2><div class="grid">{% for e in collections.ebooks %}<a class="card" href="{{ e.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">{% if e.data.cover %}<img class="cover" src="{{ e.data.cover }}" alt="">{% else %}<div class="cover">{{ e.data.title }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="b"><h3>{{ e.data.title }}</h3><span class="price">&#8358;{{ e.data.price }}</span></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><h2>Latest articles</h2>{% if collections.posts.length %}<div class="grid">{% for p in collections.posts | limit(6) %}<a class="card" href="{{ p.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div class="b"><h3>{{ p.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ p.data.description }}</p></div></a>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p>Articles are on the way. Check back soon.</p>{% endif %}</div></section>
